COMPILATION:

compile the analysis code using the provided Makefile :-

-----$ make analysis

this creates the executable:-

analysis

RUNNING:

To Run the code use:-

-----$ ./analysis <inputFiles/test.list> <OutputFile/out.root>  <jetRadius/1.0> <Output_signalFile/signal.root> <Output_backgroundFile/bkg.root> <Output_MCD0File/signalmc.root>
